mjlab
===============================================================================
This repository is derived from mjlab:
    https://github.com/mujocolab/mjlab
    Copyright 2025, The mjlab Developers
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The mjlab manager-based environment API, MDP term library, task registry,
training/evaluation scripts, viewers, terrain generation, and asset zoo are
retained in substantially their upstream form. LP-NavOA adds the circular
goal-command backbone tasks, the planner/waypoint teacher and distilling
recurrent local planner, and the navigation benchmark used in the paper.

If you use this software in research, please cite both the LP-NavOA paper
(see CITATION.cff) and mjlab.

